Package: tind-optins
Version: 0.1.6
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Morten <morten@servr.no>
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Depends: zenity, pkexec, flatpak, curl, ca-certificates, tind-extras
Installed-Size: 96
Description: Tind Apps: opt-in application installer
 A small checklist tool for the apps Tind does not install by default: the
 app boxes from the installer (games, developer tools, entertainment, creative,
 communication, productivity and cloud, printers and scanners, security).
 Apps are described by small files in /usr/share/tind/optins.d, installed from
 apt, Flathub or a setup script, and each can also be installed from the
 command line.
